{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_01",
  "title": "逃離與追逐",
  "storyCode": "FC-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "111bfc63ef030df6e2ceee4cf953d20686af74f1b272f1f0ff058299455126ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別翻你那帳本了，還想著過幾天回去推上你的小車賣東西呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，不敢想，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是做了虧心事，我就總覺得要記下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生都是聰明人，受的是什麼傷，她看一眼就知道啦。既然她沒責怪你，那就是原諒你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可她說自己不是醫生，只是在賣藥的地方上班，學過一些急救知識，所以能指揮我們處理傷口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼知道她說的是實話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說，她不是一般的醫生，但更不可能是什麼賣藥的。她帶的藥品種類那麼齊全，又出現在荒地上，多奇怪啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸對了，她手提箱裡都裝了什麼，你看清楚了嗎？你是做生意的，東西值多少錢，你心裡有數嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒仔細看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你總不能連救命恩人的行李都想搶吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，我就是隨便問問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......你那裡還有麵包嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒多少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還是分我一個吧，拜託了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，不對，你不喜歡別人叫你醫生......那個，吃塊麵包嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，一本古舊的塔拉詩歌集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，哦，原來是塔拉語......我本來就不認識多少詞，寫出來的塔拉語我就更沒見過啦，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想坐在這裡的話，沒關係的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好，呃...\n...其實我就是想為昨晚的事情謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我只是給了一些藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......清洗傷口，包紮，那些事情，我該自己做的。只是，我還做不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，那傷口我也不敢碰，確實嚇人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但我是想說，要不是你放了那把火，我們恐怕都脫不了身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，火不是我放的，我只是路過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，既然你這麼說，那就當是巧合好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，什麼深池，那些當兵的把不聽話的人都叫做深池。我們也就算了，你這樣的好心人，不該背上這麼重的罪名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你很憎恨深池？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我說不上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是從城裡來的，我還是給你提個醒吧。前段時間，深池的人來過這一帶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說他們跟維多利亞的一支軍隊撞上了，結果維多利亞人沒一個活下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事把城裡的老爺們氣壞了，所以他們從特倫特郡調了一批當兵的出來，在石高原野上四處抓人，村子也燒了好幾座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......其實你真不該救我們，不值得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我如果，不去在乎別人的生命，那我答應羅德島的事，就沒有做到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？不好意思，你說話聲音實在太小了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒什麼......你剛剛說的情況，我知道一些，路上我會小心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你這就要走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，天已經亮了，我不用你們指路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，好吧。我明白，像你這樣，把維多利亞語講得很標準的塔拉人，都不肯跟我們多說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你們見到凱莉了嗎？差不多這麼高的女人，走路時尾巴搖搖晃晃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒見到？那可以麻煩你在這附近找找嗎，醫生？她一晚上沒回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞爾蒙，你的態度怎麼突然——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，維恩，你到我這邊來幫忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g3_swamp_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，這裡有信號？那是不是意味著我們又找錯方向了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來是。這附近的通信設施沒被破壞，說明他們沒有朝這一帶前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......那羅德島有沒有說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和新聞裡說的沒什麼差別。昨晚有一小隊深池士兵在紅脊鎮放火，燒了駐軍處的一幢樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那隊士兵看起來還沒有逃到這片荒野上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的都是無效資訊。近一個月，所有移動城市都恰好遠離這片荒地，外勤幹員沒有報告任何明顯的異常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也只是見到了戰鬥留下的痕跡......從那些痕跡中，幾乎無法判斷戰鬥的規模。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯一能看出的是，交戰雙方的實力懸殊，那一隊維多利亞士兵幾乎是迅速戰敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......風笛，你在聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到你零件裝錯了方向，就知道你又走神了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，陳陳，你居然連破城矛的結構都能看明白了！我當時可是學了好久才記住怎麼維護它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......結構我倒是沒有完全看懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛在想，休斯為什麼在信裡說話總是像另一個人一樣，雖然這麼說好像沒什麼道理......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好，我相信你一向直覺很準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是覺得他總有什麼話想說不敢說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就好像我們上次去找過他之後，就有什麼人盯上他了一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，就是這種感覺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那說明我們沒有走錯路。休斯給我們的消息是準確的，準確到引起了敵人的警覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行軍路線可以隱藏，但戰備相關原材料的流向還是洩露了訊息。在過去幾個月內，被我們標記的幾支深池的部隊都在靠近這一帶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特倫特郡外面的......無人區？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳陳，你怎麼突然警......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三點鐘方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和小丘郡那個時候打扮一樣......是鬼魂部隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快跟上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，風笛......他們看起來很奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，只有幾個人站在荒野上，像是站崗一樣......是誘餌嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，可能未必。他們讓我想起一些......在龍門發生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別輕敵，我們慢慢靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
